# Magikos package list the Debian installer installs with apt-get.
# Debian counterpart of magikos-base.packages; the Arch list stays canonical
# for the ISO. Names are apt names, so several differ from the Arch spelling
# (mapping notes at the bottom).
#
# CachyOS-specific packages, the AUR helpers (yay/paru/reflector) and the Arch
# kernel/initramfs stack are deliberately absent: Debian carries its own
# xwayland, initramfs-tools and Limine packaging, and the hardware tier lives
# in magikos-other-debian.packages rather than the base session.
